1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,660
Over the last three years,

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,080
the AI boom ran on one big promise —

3
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:07,160
that interest rates would keep falling,

4
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:10,020
making it cheap to borrow billions of dollars for

5
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:11,060
giant data centers.

6
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:15,020
On Wednesday, November 25, 2026,

7
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:17,620
that promise took a direct hit.

8
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:19,700
New numbers from the U.S.

9
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:23,720
government showed overall inflation jumped to 3.8 percent

10
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:27,380
in October, while core inflation hit 3.3

11
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:30,540
percent, its highest level in nearly three years,

12
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:31,660
and the U.S.

13
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:34,840
economy grew at a fast 4.3 percent pace.

14
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:38,400
At the same time, a Federal Reserve survey warned

15
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:41,220
that businesses expect prices to keep climbing.
